===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Mysterious Treasures|Exeggutor|24}} from the {{TCG|Mysterious Treasures}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Exeggutor}}.
*{{m|Psychic}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Exeggutor}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

